{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "J-B Weld feels like a natural next choice because I have bought tape and vinyl cement for repairs; another strong adhesive serves a similar practical purpose.",
    "The degreaser and thread checker fit related repair tasks: preparing greasy surfaces and identifying fasteners I need to replace."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The test kit and temperature controller address needs I have not shown, while wall-decorating supplies do not fit the repair work suggested by my purchases.",
    "Casters require a matching mount and an actual replacement need, and the gloves require a suitable fit and material compatibility. General usefulness alone would not make me choose them.",
    "The magnets could help with a mounting project, but I would wait for a specific use; a bulk pack of trash bags also lacks a clear current purpose for me."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My purchases seem to have been interpreted as interest in almost anything used in a workshop, even when it serves an unrelated task.",
    "Buying a handtruck once does not mean I currently need wheels, just as buying repair supplies does not establish a need for every maintenance consumable."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated purchases of adhesives and clamps suggest that securing, joining, and repairing things matters more to me than simply owning tools.",
    "I choose supplies for specific jobs, so compatibility and an identifiable use matter more than whether something might eventually be handy."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "You recognized my practical repair interests, but stretched them into unrelated supplies and specialized equipment without a clear current need."
}"}
